      "heading": "Question 9 (b)",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "heading": null,
          "bullets": [
            "Candidates recalled steps in the mechanism that opens stomata but weaker responses omitted key details. A common error was to write ‘cell’ or ‘stoma’ instead of specifying that guard cells were the location of the events described. Other areas of confusion were mixing up the directions in which the two ions travelled and the mechanisms by which they moved (active transport for H<sup>+</sup> versus facilitated diffusion for K<sup>+</sup>)."
          ]
        }
